This learning project follows Darshil Parmar's Zomato AI Data Engineering
End-to-End Project:
https://github.com/darshilparmar/zomato-ai-data-engineering-end-to-end-project

Tutorial baseline: 57d147dfe6aaed6bfe7c215d74185c39358790a4
Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kYwaNMQ3XT8

The Snowflake setup and AWS IAM templates were obtained from that baseline.
The dbt models and pipeline follow the tutorial, with local adaptations.
The bounded AI provider, persistent caches, citation checks, SQL validation,
credit gates, offline tests and portable public configuration are adaptations
prepared for this project. See docs/EXPORT_ADAPTATIONS.md for details.

